  "notes": "Six gem types, each a different color AND shape so they read on small screens: gem_red (heart), gem_orange (star), gem_yellow (circle), gem_green (diamond), gem_blue (cut gem), gem_pink (pentagon). Each has a bold-outlined twin gem_<color>_special for power-ups (line clear / bomb). About 96 px; draw them at the board cell size. Board: cell (grey rounded square) and cell_alt for a checker pattern, frame (white square with border). Particles 48 px: particleyellow_1/3/5, particlewhite_1/3/5 for sparkles. coin_01/coin_02 for rewards. No background image: use a vertical gradient from palette.sky to palette.sky2. Sounds: gem (match), coin, magic (level complete), bump (invalid move), select, switch_a (swap), tap_a (tap)."
